= Frank H. Netter M.D. School of Medicine at Quinnipiac University - Prompt 04

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Beyond Your Capabilities
- Limit: 400 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Med School Insiders
- Source: https://medschoolinsiders.com/medical-school-secondary-prompts-database/quinnipiac-frank-netter-secondary-essay-prompts/
